{
  "id": "20933_shisshin",
  "headword": "{失神|しっしん}",
  "reading": "しっしん",
  "romaji": "shisshin",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "fainting; losing consciousness; blackout",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "fainting; losing consciousness; passing out",
      "explanation": "A temporary loss of consciousness, typically caused by a drop in blood pressure, shock, pain, or extreme heat. Can also be used figuratively for being overwhelmed."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "20933_shisshin_ex1",
      "japanese": "{暑|あつ}さで{失神|しっしん}した。",
      "english": "I fainted from the heat.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20933_shisshin_ex2",
      "japanese": "{彼女|かのじょ}は{突然|とつぜん}{失神|しっしん}して{倒|たお}れた。",
      "english": "She suddenly lost consciousness and collapsed.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20933_shisshin_ex3",
      "japanese": "{試合中|しあいちゅう}に{選手|せんしゅ}が{失神|しっしん}し、すぐに{救急車|きゅうきゅうしゃ}が{呼|よ}ばれた。",
      "english": "A player lost consciousness during the match, and an ambulance was called immediately.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Composed of {失|しつ} (lose) + {神|しん} (spirit/consciousness). Refers to a temporary loss of consciousness. Often used with する to form the verb {失神|しっしん}する (to faint, to pass out).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {失神|しっしん}する: to faint, to lose consciousness\n- {失神|しっしん}して{倒|たお}れる: to collapse unconscious\n- {一時的|いちじてき}な{失神|しっしん}: temporary fainting\n- {失神|しっしん}から{回復|かいふく}する: to recover from fainting\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {気絶|きぜつ}: fainting — very similar meaning, slightly more colloquial\n- {意識|いしき}を{失|うしな}う: to lose consciousness — more descriptive phrase\n- {卒倒|そっとう}: collapsing in a faint — emphasizes the falling aspect\n- {貧血|ひんけつ}: anemia — sometimes used colloquially to mean lightheadedness",
